 "html": "<img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/news/6a7067dcf2a3e.jpg\">\n<p>第12屆健喬盃女子圍棋最強戰初賽今天上午十點在海峰棋院舉行，經過數小時交戰，業餘女子冠軍陳芊瑜7段戰勝黨希昀三段，新科職棋黃名棻戰勝粟睦蓉初段。</p>\n<p>複賽開幕抽籤，將於明天上午十點舉行！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_0803%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%B1%86%E5%81%A5%E5%96%AC%E7%9B%83%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E5%9C%8D%E6%A3%8B%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E6%8A%BD%E7%B1%A4_%E5%88%9D%E8%B3%BD_260803_1.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_0803%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%B1%86%E5%81%A5%E5%96%AC%E7%9B%83%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E5%9C%8D%E6%A3%8B%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E6%8A%BD%E7%B1%A4_%E5%88%9D%E8%B3%BD_260803_2.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_0803%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%B1%86%E5%81%A5%E5%96%AC%E7%9B%83%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E5%9C%8D%E6%A3%8B%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E6%8A%BD%E7%B1%A4_%E5%88%9D%E8%B3%BD_260803_6.jpg\"></p>\n<p>陳芊瑜7段</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_0803%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%B1%86%E5%81%A5%E5%96%AC%E7%9B%83%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E5%9C%8D%E6%A3%8B%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E6%8A%BD%E7%B1%A4_%E5%88%9D%E8%B3%BD_260803_7.jpg\"></p>\n<p>新科職棋黃名棻</p>\n<p><strong>8/3初賽成績(棋譜)</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.higohigo.org/#/kifu/42641\">黃名棻7段 持白6.5目勝 粟睦蓉初段</a> <br>\n<a href=\"https://www.higohigo.org/#/kifu/42642\">陳芊瑜7段 持白中盤勝 黨希昀三段</a> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/%E5%88%9D%E8%B3%BD-01.jpg\"></p>"
